      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm surprised people still want this saved. I'm still running into plenty worlds that give me issues with interacting with the menu if I have either option turned on. Granted there aren't *a lot* but it's enough that anyone's bound to run into them and be completely flustered as to why they're suddenly unable to interact with their menu, and thus have issues turning the feature off to fix the problem, thus forcing them to restart.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
