      },
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "While I understand why it was done this way, I'd really like some way for this to save between restarts. \nI have to reenable this every single time I start the game. Yes, it breaks in _some_ worlds, but for me, not having to set it literally every single time I start VRChat would far outweigh only having to change the setting the few times I go to a world where it doesn't work correctly.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
